---
layout: base.njk
nav: deals
title: "Deals"
description: "League table de operações de M&A, dívida e equity acompanhadas pela deal.crafting."
permalink: /deals/index.html
---
<div class="page-header">
  <p class="eyebrow">Deals</p>
  <h1>League table de operações</h1>
  <p>Todas as operações de M&amp;A, dívida e equity mapeadas pela redação, atualizadas conforme os anúncios do mercado.</p>
</div>

<div class="stats-bar">
  <div class="stat">
    <span class="num">{{ dealsStats.volumeNoMes }}</span>
    <span class="label">Volume no mês</span>
  </div>
  <div class="stat">
    <span class="num">{{ dealsStats.dealsNoMes }}</span>
    <span class="label">Deals mapeados</span>
  </div>
  <div class="stat">
    <span class="num">{{ dealsStats.ticketMedio }}</span>
    <span class="label">Ticket médio</span>
  </div>
  <div class="stat">
    <span class="num">{{ dealsStats.setoresAtivos }}</span>
    <span class="label">Setores ativos</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="filters" data-filter-group=".deal-row">
  <button class="filter-btn active" data-cat="todos">Todos</button>
  <button class="filter-btn" data-cat="ma">M&amp;A</button>
  <button class="filter-btn" data-cat="divida">Dívida</button>
  <button class="filter-btn" data-cat="equity">Equity</button>
</div>

<div class="deals-table-wrap">
  <table class="deals">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Data</th>
        <th>Empresa</th>
        <th>Contraparte</th>
        <th>Tipo</th>
        <th>Valor</th>
        <th>Setor</th>
        <th>Status</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for deal in dealsList %}
      <tr class="deal-row" data-cat="{{ deal.tipo }}">
        <td class="muted-cell">{{ deal.data | dataDiaMes }}</td>
        <td class="company">{{ deal.empresa }}</td>
        <td>{{ deal.contraparte }}</td>
        <td><span class="tag {{ deal.tipo }}">{{ deal.tipoLabel }}</span></td>
        <td class="value">{{ deal.valor }}</td>
        <td class="muted-cell">{{ deal.setor }}</td>
        <td><span class="status-pill {{ deal.statusClass }}">{{ deal.status }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<section id="newsletter">
  <div class="newsletter">
    <div>
      <h2>Receba a league table completa toda semana.</h2>
      <p>Um resumo dos deals de M&amp;A, dívida e equity fechados no Brasil, com valores e contrapartes, direto no seu e-mail.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <form class="newsletter-form">
        <input type="email" placeholder="seu.email@empresa.com" required>
        <button type="submit">Assinar grátis</button>
      </form>
      <p class="newsletter-note">Sem spam. Cancele quando quiser.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
